#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:2
msgid "Add Context Without Overloading the Session"
msgstr "添加上下文而不过载会话"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:4
msgid ""
"The agent can work from the workspace boundary, the conversation, and "
"additional context you explicitly attach. Good context is specific enough"
" to answer the question without filling the model's budget with unrelated"
" files."
msgstr "agent 可以依据工作区边界、对话以及你明确附加的额外上下文工作。好的上下文应当足够具体，能够回答问题，同时不会用无关文件填满模型预算。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:9
msgid "Attach context"
msgstr "附加上下文"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:11
msgid "From the composer, add:"
msgstr "你可以从 Composer 添加："

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:13
msgid "individual files when you know the implementation location;"
msgstr "知道实现位置时，添加单个文件；"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:14
msgid "a folder when several files form one small feature;"
msgstr "多个文件共同组成一个小功能时，添加一个文件夹；"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:15
msgid "images when the task depends on a visual reference or captured result."
msgstr "任务依赖视觉参考或截图结果时，添加图像。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:17
msgid ""
"You can also refer to a path in the workspace, a Godot scene, or a "
"resource in your request. Keep the path inside the selected workspace and"
" use Godot's ``res://`` form when it makes the target unambiguous."
msgstr "你也可以在请求中引用工作区路径、Godot 场景或资源。请确保路径位于所选工作区内；当目标不够明确时，使用 Godot 的 ``res://`` 形式。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:22
msgid "Context budget"
msgstr "上下文预算"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:24
msgid ""
"Long histories and large attachments consume the selected model's context"
" budget. Studio exposes an estimate with categories such as system and "
"tools, history, current message, additional context, reserved output, and"
" safety margin."
msgstr "较长的历史记录和较大的附件会消耗所选模型的上下文预算。Studio 会显示估算值，并列出系统与工具、历史记录、当前消息、额外上下文、预留输出和安全余量等类别。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:29
msgid "If the estimate is high:"
msgstr "如果估算值较高："

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:31
msgid "Remove attachments that do not affect the task."
msgstr "移除与任务无关的附件。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:32
msgid "Ask for a focused inspection instead of attaching a whole repository."
msgstr "请求进行有针对性的检查，而不是附加整个仓库。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:33
msgid "Start a fresh session when the task has changed substantially."
msgstr "任务发生较大变化时，启动一个全新会话。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:34
msgid ""
"Use session compression when Studio makes it available and the older "
"details are no longer needed verbatim."
msgstr "当 Studio 提供会话压缩功能，且不再需要逐字保留旧细节时，使用会话压缩。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:37
msgid ""
"Compression summarizes eligible history; it does not make an active run "
"safe to interrupt or grant access to files that were not already in "
"scope."
msgstr "压缩会总结符合条件的历史记录；它不会让正在运行的任务可以安全中断，也不会授予对原本不在范围内文件的访问权限。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:41
msgid "Protect private context"
msgstr "保护私密上下文"

#: ../../source/workspaces/context.rst:43
msgid ""
"Do not attach API keys, MCP secrets, private certificates, or unrelated "
"personal documents. Review pasted logs for local usernames, absolute "
"paths, tokens, and project-specific secrets before sharing them with a "
"provider."
msgstr "不要附加 API key、MCP secret、私有证书或无关的个人文档。向供应商分享粘贴的日志前，请检查其中是否包含本机用户名、绝对路径、令牌和项目专属 secret。"
